 "_doc": "Bicycle looks (bike_model.gd builds the bike from one of these; the player's own look is saved with the bike, so later customisation only has to write a new look). A look names a style preset, then any field over it. Colours are hex. Fields: style (preset name), frame (main colour), frame2 (second colour: panels, the top tube's band, the mudguards' stripe), accent (lugs and pinstripes), metal (chrome | black | gold: bars, rims, cranks), tyre (tread), wall (tyre sidewall: gumwall cream, or the tread colour), grips, saddle, basket (none | wicker | wire), basket_col, rack (true/false), mudguards (true/false), guard_col (mudguards; frame2 when empty), chainguard (true/false), bell (dome | ding | none), bell_col, lamp (true/false), sticker (pokeball | bolt | star | leaf | none), sticker_col, size (1 = a grown-up's bike for Ash's height; 0.8 a kid's), frame_kind (diamond | step: a step-through), seat_up (m the seatpost is raised over the fit for the rider), rider_fit (true: the seat and bars fit the rider's legs at mount).",
